{"id":"34436318","title":"除了三角梅，华农到底还有多少花在开： | 今日立冬","published_at":"2026-11-07T08:03:00+08:00","published_label":"2026-11-07","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDCuXBYNjTSXUibOibUmnluIphTLYT7d2fCd0InN4Lu2TlVjU4AHxnVaY9RSKKEdjOtDcsS8icCO3GAicjqoZbJyicNxaTfMMa0NRbc/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"华农二十四节气 【编者按】“初冬天气暖，小似立春时。”今日立冬，当北方多地已是秋收完毕、秋裤加身，身处广州的华农师生们依然身着短袖。校园里，晚稻正待归仓，繁花仍","tags":["校园"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/HDlpxmCkPfAuJNPh6WwYKA","paper_url":"https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34436318","word_count":1926,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:02:29+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4480476665726320640&amp;from_itemidx=1&amp;from_msgid=2652900186&amp;subscene=159&amp;subscene=&amp;scenenote=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FAtR6E23PAWeSH_ti8LRDoQ&amp;mid=2652900186&amp;idx=1&amp;nolastread=1#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcib9OUORJLexR67iaNiaHMVsUPknEibMf4Uo8CQXCjxfPMCK0bH1LUP02sicTX6l7xja7licFNg6joVtCfw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0Fr0lUzicdOxfepxtcPXV3REoQbcek9mz23QvnibmsfV2dzGnr5nI0MfAib6aAOpF0ehg9b7TgWibI8OA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>华农二十四节气</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>【编者按】“初冬天气暖，小似立春时。”今日立冬，当北方多地已是秋收完毕、秋裤加身，身处广州的华农师生们依然身着短袖。校园里，晚稻正待归仓，繁花仍在盛开，落羽杉开始变红，再过几天，天气即将降温。</span></p><p><span>今天，走进《华农二十四节气》第十九站，看华农如何从容迎冬。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>立</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>冬</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/efUQUxiaUshL8ic4fRasDfe9hTWAbGW2dE2F08B4w74j1c6gX715m8SN0HN3ibHgfB6y8LevAiaQ10L653BKY7WEfdD3KCXe2fY4HibFkG77Tpib4/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/efUQUxiaUshJRsu1jlBhu4WvTpDiaVJKDLOuRd171dHAaq58yGzw0pdibBWPfKv2GPxhP7icfPukV3nsCjMO6PCjMMpicqOuN4f1ic67EFkLBesKo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>万物收藏</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/rXjHfuiamBuUV4vicmYxH6zKfsick9kBGh3m1icCLzOyiaTWJP0e5okWc1XnoibsHbt9vxP4iaRGSkVQegZkczEwc7xLfKgib1XFhaJPd6OL0wCHruY/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>点击视频，走进华农立冬</span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCJgtgXQumPPSIdxkh1fco1DtbnlADJ5mz3TvicUaZreRGibdamlp1L4zOUWbvRB4MHQibv4WfcDltwXGibvicMoPYGrA5X8VXxt3Mk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDktc99iaYCOtgicyAspOCtYrUHjmMXITn501ds4yXMp8rYCQw26dPiatbDoQPgJw9jY619zkyWDTJLfbTpEgwsOJC7EicFP12nwmI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckD1Wqn3F1vDiaa26KwY1woXLLnHbQ5NyKF5icIebLAnIEH6COtcOc8m4zkKONicPTPyCKdAf8KupqySxGeib8XHgFzyrU07TicrIBAQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDqDOBCjsE75K1ErIpQof7ibvNGr443c2pbjWbbEQE0jA6QLtQVqKDnEriaqbCnTFeibyOf6YnE6LLbLnrTTddacCj386tZHyLuXY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckD3DtgmhEghelXPmezRTpiaKDQAUZcyeTT9WzYgY9uG75asiaxXDEriaynOoNTz3BqF55X4R8OpmoGZGmiaUX0qGxazibHIwibcibdTN0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBAJsu9ZkoSFmoHZc3mpkffQBYibAwGKE8T8OxBKJ7Mv1Sy0RAUnT0iaJaVetvRzcMjryib5NNnuynuQiaWE3fZTpf7O4N9qzY6MKM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><span>古语说立冬三候：“一候水始冰，二候地始冻，三候雉入大水为蜃。”意思是，此时北方水面开始结冰，土地逐渐冻结，野鸡等大鸟少见，海边却多了大蛤的踪影。但在岭南，初冬的寒气只是客气地敲了敲门，真正的冬天，还慢悠悠地走在路上。</span></span></p><p><span><span>正如民谚所说：“八月暖，九月温，十月还有小阳春。”启林北的涂鸦墙下，阳光正好，这里是许多华农人进出启林的必经之路，骑车的、步行的，从墙下穿梭而过。热闹、松弛，带着初冬特有的慢节奏。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>芙蓉妆冬色，绿丛生花瀑</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>LIDONG</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCYDT4ZsicGbpNgaRWiaB18thlAHDrmE4X3jvEj9VVZeBbPRUXmsrUuoSRicnnXzkVAiabBTWZeCVDylia6BOczmS31FEkrF5v7ZWuk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>虽然已是立冬，但漫步校园，你会发现立冬的华农并未显露萧瑟。不仅未见萧瑟，还有繁花盛开。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDf8TqxNGMz2825ojnODRD0LyrqTXww23eLAhXWLjhePHgHkQ8thy5PCRsJPBGkhM8ibMrgicq6ZTKV4ib4dzT3UgUr4EGgB1ESOw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>异木棉</span></span></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAwJnmnXjAUoz5iazrXK4x21XMicbdvoHgYsDj9JUFWHIzvYCgKINA7qGr6jvJwKJTJ4PyL9W9krz6G5LFupbLF1JRrR2Owia3W1k/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCiaN6E0rFKwAqIwib1E7zUsc3UZP7icicLEWQs9ZSnQeQxmeqLkffmklWzHSrAxzVCPOsC5JAUSia8yan5weA1L1uLcem7fmmbQ2nA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBoayTOgSm2Ky7LRxdtyd4v9waxQ10G9bsRlo5k8Kj9TM7wHib9KWkouWnicPzqSUNAjhRrvIBdjpELX3HKrkqnbjDleLW6wF9pw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></section><section><span><span>三角梅</span></span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDNbbo3n2eRtchqUCUNkp4rMzXicTBwR8swdnsTHRvtoOiaRHnDIeXIw7cA4iadrFmjPMDSzbxLtNRqfeliaRHm5ySibBTzEOYicVFXY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDpn3BJ0znA9zicaFdXTuia8rILJPxSoXAx4b9zGb8Yy3GERZAI45sDrnDicauTnK0wtlIokVjrTsfdIP0Uu0zJeMCsbjvkbba7mI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAHoJzzpIPlicllGL27Kz09wKycicQv5vZP84M2ZK90QErss5JiaHm6YGkQhEhQIg1vCawlh0UnxyNOD6M9D25z0GINN8sTbbJteI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAd0vwwiaY5PXzCIsJYmc0dhXAoDT4dfDNYibibvgweorRCTvetm8Svib1c44ysTefMD0UOfNlsiaKu7wgGFAhNjxbJOYtvplCMLHBQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>鸡蛋花</span></span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCDu32MMxLriak83UFiclyGjTmsnblnYhZiaMbicGvYdplBmekly1clAuosKYGlHm21O3w9NHKZ95SwaoicPYbqvtXWTsR5lNtG5lGw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckC7Nt77qdnt4hU7FPz1riaODY7QhSdIwqIt8N4fLt46HBIyq2xmG0gGJdw00FjEHAVF1EcickJv8CIMq16QRC1m1EtUiatICTrnI8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDh7kHYv1DhVmJOu3fuVNke9ibccK0RBtXsrI7ibKJibf5v1OovXpvibxeIgQOkMZlHI9FCBrg9fAFicibWmagIRZv5Hk89b6yPxMciaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>木芙蓉</span></span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckB78q6WU2ox6mJqLynzVwTA9orBLzia5E6W9gjOLxhICyGdDf4ftjiahF61ibictbEJMzyolAtDvy39BOlI4k3hCibPL2iaxkia4Pib7Bk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBDYRBBZklkZHJq6ic74m1YFahyw8lKUIbEx5aV1HbGyyxb6k9VIRSneHrbVZXibib08xmOfsUCYblDaWh5eQ2sm1PcZibNAlibBzZA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDghzEr2EQGEUibd9u2ethE079e4HW4mV12R3AsQLeZJ9BJ6Tof6f9hmXfEeqNFR34tLW9GenlZBGCcTbC3qFqr4DPLye0AdmM0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section><section><span><span>含羞草</span></span></section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAPG8X2MlR2SbhKx2d6icpBxG1hdIj5sZkNWRpbViclqHVdSZZVXsnw9kiaqcicW1TByR6zbnNLIF2KFMwszBQ6OLksiauo19XM9Vyo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section><section><span><span>睡觉的小猫和鸡蛋花</span></span></section><p><span><span>西湖、农林讲习所门楼、竹园餐厅旁，三角梅表现抢眼。紫红色的苞片繁花艳艳，热烈绚烂地攀附延展。</span></span></p><p><span><span>马克思主义学院附近的围墙边，几株木芙蓉正值盛花期。</span></span><span><span>木芙蓉别称</span></span><span><span>“拒霜花”，而岭南的冬天，霜是稀客，于是别的花在“收声”，它反倒一层层地把颜色铺开，进入了盛花期。</span></span><span><span>木芙蓉</span></span><span><span>一日要变三次脸色：清晨初绽，瓣色如玉，清清白白；挨过正午的太阳，慢慢晕开一层浅粉；待到暮色四合，整朵沉成胭脂红。同一根枝上，白的自白、粉的自粉、红的自红，新老花次第叠着，把一整天的光景都敛进花瓣里。古人说它“晓妆如玉暮如霞”，苏轼也赞叹“千林扫作一番黄，只有芙蓉独自芳”</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>第一教学楼旁，鸡蛋花也迟迟不肯谢幕，与金灿灿的丁颖像交相呼应。</span></span><span><span>校医院前，含羞草的翠绿羽状复叶在暖阳下悄然铺展，毛茸茸的花球缀在其间，吸引寻香而来的蜜蜂。</span></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCWVnbSSyyDT8H3yUibhXiaL8JOUlYKmxl8ldl6ACpTQwkSF3X2KbRcTiceEV10bvlCQCQZbyBe1Krm2Y7vvGo806RyA8ByYNsSxE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/><span>垂枝红千层</span></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBP7UICezuW2ewGSUAHLeicwlpQQDEQIm9cpDYTUDYXB3tbz35PXd9MH4Apdo8I6uow1EticI0YcxyCIjY8TJnJRsXjleOrA4QUc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><span>白千层花</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAicHZ3RtCt5ib37T27PjeCgYUT5KIicJYWXNVYMDChJebb38Gv1gyIxZHt8SvpO6SGKWnPmAD8sjnpCPF8UFwT58RRPyUVLZPwCY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>肾茶花</span></span></p><section><p><span>“立冬犹十日，衣亦未装绵。”人文与法学学院教授王福昌感慨，“你看校园里，木芙蓉盛开，垂枝红千层和白千层花也探出头来......草木顺应天时、向阳而生，在百花里体悟自然的韧性，正是节气文化带给我们的人文启迪。”</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBvPgZMhE4XJ39EZ8j1V80qUhibGwgK3qQHTlzZV8GKXiaMc99oyDJkVZz9xevtbyibw9AFxDfLq9URT4Y1HN38zJA1QljL5Wj1g0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCKAkoTEko5aicDfjT8v1B8tXEibL5umibtTjVN0kAcko6HAjWdRozyy2t9oyA9iartjcvxpHZtZsAeeXnI4y1L0hLiapCAJqzRKA7w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAhbE8yPBpjWwhGPRItHPiahVO5V6VVakYE1RD3VaqXZUYgmwib8Eyn9Lphj7BSMcJ13BKjbsuuUInUXVOXLib3suSP0t6ibB9g88M/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBO7gwEosZ5XyGpdqKrDSgbMzRt3xMibAEPMstluKJP7gsbEkDjPbmAFq2vj0icq20IV0wxv6xI7sBwZpZ1FxZW8HmneWmttVat8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>湖边的落羽杉也悄悄起了变化。枝梢透出一点红色，像是终于接收到了冬天的信号。但走近细看——大部分羽叶还是绿色的。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>立冬收金稻，深虑防寒潮</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>LIDONG</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCYDT4ZsicGbpNgaRWiaB18thlAHDrmE4X3jvEj9VVZeBbPRUXmsrUuoSRicnnXzkVAiabBTWZeCVDylia6BOczmS31FEkrF5v7ZWuk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>立冬的暖意再浓，也拦不住农时的脚步。此时，启林北的试验田正换上金黄“秋装”。沉甸甸的稻穗低垂着头，风吹过，稻浪沙沙作响，混着阳光的暖意和稻谷的清香。</span></span></p><p><span><span>师生们抢抓晴好天气，弯腰挥镰，稻秆应声而断；脱粒机轰鸣，金黄的谷粒跳跃着落入麻袋。一旁的记录本上，株高、穗长、千粒重……每一项数据都关系着来年的播种计划。</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBnIdWXvxCv7oqwLib6azEWSREqiaguOGdl5WCIe1gvRBocrV2icn1OURO8ZbluAnJoI274eA7icPTe3L2h3IN3hAf2Vuqt7bk5YLc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCm1mGicM9W1iaZ2987SGOuQFBrFufMJibdTsXqqbX1MgExs96OSzFoV91iciciaefic0GuJpT80kulfASw4bshBZic9pzDwjeN9GDS84c/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDjsmRnpngiaFY1jOOaA5yT7pSwQp8icEjLxpzFxI6RweD5kyxDs1PicPE9Nq7SeQsxNAC4QVhiaEM30O1LX9dwrR4wTUY1yV5KXpw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckA6zPdMnXnInYkNDuRTOFianW25iawJ0pMDWXDQW85Z0TajMyDPhO7urV2dfNG27J5H0or8r4c2gZROLn8BiaQO2QCqzkcgQoQH7E/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAPH5aiaxkOTyyt3Zewzk52ib7eUdSJqHhWzwCdgOywYPWSGC6jdrLj45AHVkibE674AVBnvNoWXzou1MjrpgHiaT6jYz8ZBmzWWSM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>试验田里晚稻成熟</span></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>不过，广州的冬天虽来得慢，气温却随时可能“变脸”。刚收完这块田，防备寒潮的准备就得立刻跟上。</span></span></p><p><span><span>“广州立冬常伴‘十月小阳春’，冷热交织、气温突变极易导致植物误判时节，造成冻害。”林学与风景园林学院博士生导师吴永彬介绍，防冻抗寒是当前田间管理的重点，“我们会提前采取防寒措施，持续开展作物耐寒性鉴定与筛选，培育和推广耐寒品种，把田里的损失挡在寒潮之前。”</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>烟火慰寒意，一盅暖初冬</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>LIDONG</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckD3gXIibia8qdnL5RjQUw53t8dC3CL2nWrc9xyLI809icKOl9LhDLVRaOiafZOS5ibPYY9icyTuibjhNic1x7h5sEI7ZS2hbBtrLnYaF70/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAb2FnvD8VFss4CbenetjYjWl9E4l4icOft5ksYtNsIT0FnKVDyiaVSmkq1TibY5XWhNlkiaRIkcJoib8rGdibajJzp1lHnVshcWNJCw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><p><span>枇杷花花苞</span></p></section></section><p><span><span>俗话说“立冬补冬，补嘴空”，在广东，防寒的终极武器永远是一碗热气腾腾的老火汤。枇杷花煲汤、甘蔗羊肉汤……掀开砂锅盖的瞬间，白气蒸腾，甜香混着肉香直往鼻子里钻，冬日的寒意便被驱散了大半。劳作一天后，一口靓汤下肚，是对辛苦最好的慰藉。</span></span></p><p><span><span>除了炖汤，立冬吃腊味也是广东特色。腊肠、腊肉、腊鸭，经过腌制晾晒散发出独特香味，蒸着吃或炒菜都让人食欲大增。在岭南文化中，节气的仪式感往往体现在热气腾腾的饮食里。一餐热饭下肚，不只是食材的精华，更是广东人从容应对季节更替、热爱生活的哲学。</span></span></p><section><p><span>立冬已至，万物收藏</span></p><p><span>繁花依旧，降温在即</span></p><p><span>愿你在这个冬天</span></p><p><span>有忙有闲，有汤有伴</span></p><p><span>岁岁安然，万事顺遂</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBQHiaAQjiaeGpicTeWgo6lGE1oVhlbUpZmlJell2jQM8xcZR5q4DI26khRaCwOQKqZSwvOOE0jNwKuuvtyIM8J7YeHUq4X790now/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652900186&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=37aa75f48d26dcdadf5f566e77d1315f&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652900186&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=37aa75f48d26dcdadf5f566e77d1315f&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652900186&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=37aa75f48d26dcdadf5f566e77d1315f&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652900186&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=37aa75f48d26dcdadf5f566e77d1315f&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckC4LOYYzCgTb4siam6poSKicpJAULsn5ib1lutVqK2t1EQFTX9HyyPP4IplsyVYusUZj4v6W9WJEEurc3WozXYwtfH2tHlTibxzeh4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/</span></strong><strong></strong></span><span><span><span>你敢信，这是广州的秋天！｜今日霜降</span></span></span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652901626&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2dd7e530b270a4f9328a09f16de7fc18&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCUITUTu6D7EiaDspyicmyrpSD8EMO573qXhsmqmicU9nG02CUEpMLHsrYLKWasUwo5lnAeGwGM4GcZKugVkvwD7RDVmTvjCFib1u8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span><span><span>能盖章的华农酸奶？华农这个大展开幕！</span></span></strong></span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652900907&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=29b140eaca6cdf4e8116c962d53aa58e&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer